                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f9e1e51a-bb55-32f4-be95-57e3ccc70f4c",
                        "entry_id": "592d24f5-56af-3354-9928-ba83ccb6dd72",
                        "glosses": [
                            "daguerreotype"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "75355ce9-9e27-44ab-8977-8525ac6953bd",
                                "sense_id": "f9e1e51a-bb55-32f4-be95-57e3ccc70f4c",
                                "text": "— С ва́ми нет её портре́та?\n— Нет. (В то вре́мя о фотогра́фиях ещё поми́ну не́ было. Дагерроти́пы едва́ ста́ли распространя́ться.)",
                                "translation": "'You have not got her portrait with you?'\n'No,' (At that time photography was not yet talked off. Daguerreotypes had hardly begun to be common.)",
                                "english": "'You have not got her portrait with you?'\n'No,' (At that time photography was not yet talked off. Daguerreotypes had hardly begun to be common.)"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
